# The addresses the agent answers, and what answers them. The word after
# the plus in the address selects a row: mail to you+fable reaches the
# claude driver running Fable.
#
# A model of "-" leaves the driver's own default alone, which is what
# the driver's own name is for. Adding a model is a line here and
# nothing else: one .forward serves every address.
#
# alias       driver   model

claude        claude   -
fable         claude   fable
opus          claude   opus
sonnet        claude   sonnet
haiku         claude   haiku

codex         codex    -
astra         codex    gpt-6-astra
sol           codex    gpt-5.6-sol
terra         codex    gpt-5.6-terra
luna          codex    gpt-5.6-luna
mini          codex    gpt-5.4-mini
